{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BAPBAP is a roguelike party game where you craft the most unfair builds to make your friends hate you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Invite and play with up to 7 friends in an all out brawl. Pick a random power after every round and craft</i> <i>the most ridiculous (or regrettable) build possible.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>BAPBAP is best played with friends who can handle betrayal. Set up custom games with wild rulesets, or jump into community-run servers and embrace the chaos. No matchmaking. No ranks. Just pure, dumb fun.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_1_-_Style_on_Enemies_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, free-flowing combat that\u2019ll have you screaming for your mom to get the camera. Everything is dodgeable so if you get clapped, that\u2019s on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Style_on_Enemies_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_2_-_Play_as_a_Duck_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or a goldfish piloting a mech. Or a Russian samurai. Or ramen with legs. Each characters comes with it\u2019s own unique skillset and there\u2019s a character design for everyone\u2014even the freaks \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\ud83d\udc44\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Play_as_a_Duck_v2.2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_3_-_Pick_your_Poison_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s turning into a giant metallic duck, speccing into turretmancy, or literal poison, every game will present you with freshly randomized build combos to gamba with. Build synergies, get winnergies.   <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Pick_Your_Poison_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_4_-_Master_the_Environment_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Block escape routes with a crane\u2019s payload, transform into a vending machine for a sneaky ambush, or do a drive-by in a 1942 Panzerkampfwagon Tiger Tank. BAPBAP is a PvP sandbox where nothing make sense but also everything makes sense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Master_the_Env_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_5_-_Adapt_to_Chaos_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On top of all that, you could get ganked by a roaming giga slime, fish up a nuclear bomb or come face to tentacle with [redacted]\u00a0 - the better you are at adapting, the more you\u2019ll win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Adapt_to_Chaos_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_6_-_Get_those_Big_Plays_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s the turnaround 1v3, hitting a sweet multi-target knock up or just watching your mates get hit by their own trap \u2013 BAPBAP is here to help you get that sweet hit of dopamine in this increasingly depressing world. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Make_those_Big_Plays_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to BAPBAP, where logic goes to die. </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2226280?t=1744642739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744642739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/d829d9f64c57fef4416eac1789a20f09f0d534f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744642739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/d829d9f64c57fef4416eac1789a20f09f0d534f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744642739","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>We hate money</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make a BAPBAP account during Early Access and get the Character Pack (US$10) for free!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BAPBAP is a roguelike party game where you craft the most unfair builds to make your friends hate you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Invite and play with up to 7 friends in an all out brawl. Pick a random power after every round and craft</i> <i>the most ridiculous (or regrettable) build possible.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>BAPBAP is best played with friends who can handle betrayal. Set up custom games with wild rulesets, or jump into community-run servers and embrace the chaos. No matchmaking. No ranks. Just pure, dumb fun.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_1_-_Style_on_Enemies_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, free-flowing combat that\u2019ll have you screaming for your mom to get the camera. Everything is dodgeable so if you get clapped, that\u2019s on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Style_on_Enemies_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_2_-_Play_as_a_Duck_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or a goldfish piloting a mech. Or a Russian samurai. Or ramen with legs. Each characters comes with it\u2019s own unique skillset and there\u2019s a character design for everyone\u2014even the freaks \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\ud83d\udc44\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Play_as_a_Duck_v2.2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_3_-_Pick_your_Poison_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s turning into a giant metallic duck, speccing into turretmancy, or literal poison, every game will present you with freshly randomized build combos to gamba with. Build synergies, get winnergies.   <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Pick_Your_Poison_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_4_-_Master_the_Environment_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Block escape routes with a crane\u2019s payload, transform into a vending machine for a sneaky ambush, or do a drive-by in a 1942 Panzerkampfwagon Tiger Tank. BAPBAP is a PvP sandbox where nothing make sense but also everything makes sense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Master_the_Env_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_5_-_Adapt_to_Chaos_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On top of all that, you could get ganked by a roaming giga slime, fish up a nuclear bomb or come face to tentacle with [redacted]\u00a0 - the better you are at adapting, the more you\u2019ll win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Adapt_to_Chaos_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Text_6_-_Get_those_Big_Plays_2.png?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s the turnaround 1v3, hitting a sweet multi-target knock up or just watching your mates get hit by their own trap \u2013 BAPBAP is here to help you get that sweet hit of dopamine in this increasingly depressing world. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/Make_those_Big_Plays_v2.gif?t=1744642739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to BAPBAP, where logic goes to die. </strong></p>","developers":["BAP HQ"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/02658c8c0de61231dbdd4044ee58cb8cbc947607/header.jpg?t=1744642739","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS X 10.11 (El Capitan) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Duo Processor (2GHz or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> ATI Radeon HD 2400 or better / NVIDIA 8600M or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113601,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113601/movie480.mp4?t=1741822496","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113601/movie_max.mp4?t=1741822496"},"name":"BAPBAP Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113601/84020e30dae51cd55e45782f99e4202eef2d5802/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741822496","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113601/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741822496","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113601/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741822496"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257078966,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257078966/movie480.mp4?t=1741822498","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com